StructElem>>endobj5864 0 obj<</K[28]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5865 0 obj<</K[29]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5866 0 obj<</E(   CORE CONSTRUCTION: Our transformer cores are made from CRGO low-loss electrical grade laminations in line with the latest IS standards. Laminations are coated with oil-resistant insulation on both sides and are tested for physical and dielectric proper\ties. )/K[7 8]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(   CORE CONSTRUCTION: Our transformer cores are made from CRGO low-loss electrical grade laminations in line with the latest IS standards. Laminations are coated with oil-resistant insulation on both sides and are tested for physical and dielectric proper\ties. )/Type/StructElem>>endobj5867 0 obj<</K[30]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5868 0 obj<</E(  WINDINGS: We use high-conductivity, paper-covered copper and aluminium conductors to meet stringent electrical, mechanical, and thermal requirements. Conductors are annealed for optimal softness and insulation is tested for ash content and moisture abso\rption.)/K[9]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(  WINDINGS: We use high-conductivity, paper-covered copper and aluminium conductors to meet stringent electrical, mechanical, and thermal requirements. Conductors are annealed for optimal softness and insulation is tested for ash content and moisture abso\rption.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5869 0 obj<</K[31]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5870 0 obj<</E( CONNECTIONS & TAPINGS: End connections are crimped or brazed, then clamped to ensure mechanical strength and low resistance. Tap-changing is achieved through off-circuit tap switches with an external, pad-lockable handle. Our tap switches are robustly de\signed with high-grade contacts to ensure long, trouble-free service. They accommodate voltage variations of ±10% in up to 8 steps.)/K[10]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T( CONNECTIONS & TAPINGS: End connections are crimped or brazed, then clamped to ensure mechanical strength and low resistance. Tap-changing is achieved through off-circuit tap switches with an external, pad-lockable handle. Our tap switches are robustly de\signed with high-grade contacts to ensure long, trouble-free service. They accommodate voltage variations of ±10% in up to 8 steps.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5871 0 obj<</K[32]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5872 0 obj<</K[33]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5873 0 obj<</K[34]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5874 0 obj<</K[35]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5875 0 obj<</K[36]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5876 0 obj<</E( TERMINATIONS: We provide terminal arrangements as per customer requirements, including cable boxes with cable entry glands for both H.V and L.V sides. Our transformers use porcelain bushings conforming to IS: 3347/1965.)/K[15]/Pg 1 0 R/S/P/Type/StructElem>>endobj5877 0 obj<</K[37]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5878 0 obj<</K[38]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5879 0 obj<</E(    QUALITY ASSURANCE: We understand the critical importance of quality. Every stage of manufacturing undergoes strict quality checks. Our quality control process integrates engineering expertise, manufacturing experience and superior raw materials to del\iver a product with inherently high standards.)/K[5]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(    QUALITY ASSURANCE: We understand the critical importance of quality. Every stage of manufacturing undergoes strict quality checks. Our quality control process integrates engineering expertise, manufacturing experience and superior raw materials to del\iver a product with inherently high standards.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5880 0 obj<</K[39]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5881 0 obj<</E(    INSULATION AND IMPREGNATION:  We use only high-grade electrical Kraft paper and pressboard as per IS:1576. These materials are selected for their high dielectric strength, moisture resistance, aging properties, and compatibility with transformer oil. \Insulating varnish is used to impregnate windings. Fibre Glass Insulations \(as per IS: 1923\) further enhance insulation reliability.)/K[0 1]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(    INSULATION AND IMPREGNATION:  We use only high-grade electrical Kraft paper and pressboard as per IS:1576. These materials are selected for their high dielectric strength, moisture resistance, aging properties, and compatibility with transformer oil. \Insulating varnish is used to impregnate windings. Fibre Glass Insulations \(as per IS: 1923\) further enhance insulation reliability.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5882 0 obj<</K[40]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5883 0 obj<</K[41]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5884 0 obj<</E(   DESIGN STANDARDS: We design and test our products in accordance with IS: 2026, IS: 1180, IEC: 76, BS: 171 and customer-specific requirements.)/K[14]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(   DESIGN STANDARDS: We design and test our products in accordance with IS: 2026, IS: 1180, IEC: 76, BS: 171 and customer-specific requirements.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5885 0 obj<</K[42]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5886 0 obj<</K[43]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5887 0 obj<</K[44]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5888 0 obj<</E(   TANK FABRICATION: All transformer tanks are constructed using high-grade, tested mild steel. The design ensures adequate thickness to withstand internal pressure. Leak testing is performed at 0.5 kg/cm² or higher, ensuring even minute leaks are detecte\d. Pressed steel radiators are used for improved cooling efficiency. Radiators are individually pressure-tested before mounting. All welding is done to stringent standards using jigs and fixtures for dimensional accuracy. )/K[11 12]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(   TANK FABRICATION: All transformer tanks are constructed using high-grade, tested mild steel. The design ensures adequate thickness to withstand internal pressure. Leak testing is performed at 0.5 kg/cm² or higher, ensuring even minute leaks are detecte\d. Pressed steel radiators are used for improved cooling efficiency. Radiators are individually pressure-tested before mounting. All welding is done to stringent standards using jigs and fixtures for dimensional accuracy. )/Type/StructElem>>endobj5889 0 obj<</K[45]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5890 0 obj<</E(  TESTING: Each transformer undergoes routine testing in our fully equipped testing facilities, conforming to IS: 2026 standards. A detailed test certificate and Guarantee is provided for every unit.)/K[13]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(  TESTING: Each transformer undergoes routine testing in our fully equipped testing facilities, conforming to IS: 2026 standards. A detailed test certificate and Guarantee is provided for every unit.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5891 0 obj<</K[46]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5892 0 obj<</E(  TRANSPOSITIONS: In multi-conductor windings, transpositions are incorporated to ensure uniform current distribution and minimize circulating currents.)/K[2]/Pg 1 0 R/S/H2/T(  TRANSPOSITIONS: In multi-conductor windings, transpositions are incorporated to ensure uniform current distribution and minimize circulating currents.)/Type/StructElem>>endobj5893 0 obj<</K[47]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5894 0 obj<</K[48]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5895 0 obj<</K[49]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5896 0 obj<</K[50]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5897 0 obj<</K[51]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5898 0 obj<</K[52]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj5899 0 obj<</K[53]/P 5902 0 R/Pg 1 0 R/S/Figure/Type/StructElem>>endobj590